<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h3 tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto">Agentic (Multi-LoRA)</h3><a id="user-content-agentic-multi-lora" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Agentic (Multi-LoRA)" href="#agentic-multi-lora"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<p dir="auto">LoRA adapter switching for multi-tenant deployments.</p>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-yaml notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="- name: qwen3-8b-nvfp4-agentic-lora-c32
  vllm:
    enable_lora: true
    max_loras: 3
    lora_modules:
      - name: customer-support
        path: /models/loras/customer-support
      - name: code-assistant
        path: /models/loras/code-assistant
  aiperf:
    model_selection_strategy: random  # Randomly select adapter per request"><pre>- <span class="pl-ent">name</span>: <span class="pl-s">qwen3-8b-nvfp4-agentic-lora-c32</span>
  <span class="pl-ent">vllm</span>:
    <span class="pl-ent">enable_lora</span>: <span class="pl-c1">true</span>
    <span class="pl-ent">max_loras</span>: <span class="pl-c1">3</span>
    <span class="pl-ent">lora_modules</span>:
      - <span class="pl-ent">name</span>: <span class="pl-s">customer-support</span>
        <span class="pl-ent">path</span>: <span class="pl-s">/models/loras/customer-support</span>
      - <span class="pl-ent">name</span>: <span class="pl-s">code-assistant</span>
        <span class="pl-ent">path</span>: <span class="pl-s">/models/loras/code-assistant</span>
  <span class="pl-ent">aiperf</span>:
    <span class="pl-ent">model_selection_strategy</span>: <span class="pl-s">random  </span><span class="pl-c"><span class="pl-c">#</span> Randomly select adapter per request</span></pre></div>
<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h2 tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto">Metrics Collected</h2><a id="user-content-metrics-collected" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Metrics Collected" href="#metrics-collected"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
